def _decode_document(raw: str) -> Any:
    """Decode a stored document, unwrapping the layers it may arrive in.

    A value read out of a page crosses two boundaries that both encode it: the
    page serializes the stored string, and the protocol serializes the result
    again.  A document therefore arrives as a JSON object, or as a JSON string
    that itself holds one.  Each layer is unwrapped until a document appears,
    and the value is returned unchanged when there is nothing further to
    unwrap.
    """
